                          <Text><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial">Rohrunterlage, Polysterol, für [PERSON_177], 1000 x 150 x100 mm, kürzbar.</span><span style="text-align:left; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial"/><br/></Text>
